{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410213001:1":{"text":"ここが製錬所です。我々の製品はどれも、職人たちが手作業で一つ一つ仕上げているのですよ。","source_cn":"这就是我们的冶炼所了，所有的成品都是在这里，由我们一锤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885F92F1CF0EBD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410213002:1":{"text":"ハガルド！何が人手が足りないだ。十分足りているじゃないか！","source_cn":"铁须，我看这里人手还足够啊！你怎么能谎报情况呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCDA2EE78F9DA6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410213003:1":{"text":"本当に足りないんだって！信じられないなら、ヘラさんに聞いてくれよ！","source_cn":"就是缺人手啊！不信你去问海拉，看她怎么说？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85AA6789E7A9EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410213004:1":{"text":"あとで彼女にも確認するが、客人の前で騒ぐのは――","source_cn":"我待会跟她确认情况，但你当着贵客的面先嚷嚷起来，这——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970126BECC4DDE8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410213005:1":{"text":"そう咎めてやるな。こうして実際に経験するのも大事な視察だ。せっかく来たんだ、ぜひここの責任者とも話がしてみたい。","source_cn":"别介意！参观和体验也是我们视察进度的重要部分。既然来到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x446E6EC03A739DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410213006:1":{"text":"し、しかし、ヘラは……少々荒っぽい女性でして。やはりここは私が――","source_cn":"特使大人！海拉……她脾气暴躁，不太会跟人打交道。还是让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE6E183D6F47BEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410213007:1":{"text":"かまわんよ。礼儀作法に疎いのは俺も同じだ。あちらにいる女性かね？さっそく挨拶してこよう。","source_cn":"没关系，我也是个粗人。就是那位吗？我去打个招呼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x583DF9A49AB8BC73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410213008:1":{"text":"お、お待ちください。私も一緒に行きますよ！","source_cn":"哎……特使大人，那我陪你们一起过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3D0D3B868FDBD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗林":{"text":"フリン","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"職人のハガルド","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"ホーガン","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}